  "description": "This is a little helper NuGet package providing reusable test infrastructure shared across mu88's .NET apps:\n      - Resolve pinned Testcontainers image references from a Renovate-trackable Dockerfile\n      - Start and connect to a Testcontainers-based Playwright browser instance\n      - Build an app's Docker image via Microsoft.NET.Build.Containers for use in system tests\n      - Assert that a running app/container is healthy and free of warnings in its logs",
